&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&amp;nbsp;managing day-to-day website update, including publishing content, images, and pages using a CMS (Eg. GovTech Optical).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding in using web analytics tools to monitor traffic and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in performing ticket triaging, escalation, and resolution in accordance with SLAs using a ticketing system (Eg. JIRA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to create and maintain relevant knowledge repository on systems, processes, and queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
